WEBVTT

00:00:06.702 --> 00:00:10.613
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What are the top things people look for every day?

00:00:11.294 --> 00:00:16.153
At number 8, it’s… wallets and purses.

00:00:17.804 --> 00:00:20.423
At number 7 umbrellas.

00:00:22.266 --> 00:00:25.184
At number 6 bank cards.

00:00:26.721 --> 00:00:29.574
At number 5 phone chargers.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.199
And now for the top four.

00:00:33.984 --> 00:00:38.370
At number 4 glasses and sunglasses.

00:00:39.714 --> 00:00:43.167
At number 3 pens and pencils.

00:00:44.464 --> 00:00:47.909
And at number 2 mobile phones.

00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:57.755
And at number 1 – yes, that’s right – keys. House keys and car keys.